#: ../../docs/about/introduction.rst:21
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Welcome to the official documentation of **Godot Engine**, the free and open "
"source community-driven 2D and 3D game engine! Behind this mouthful, you "
"will find a powerful yet user-friendly tool that you can use to develop any "
"kind of game, for any platform and with no usage restriction whatsoever."
msgstr ""
"Maligayang pagdating sa opisyal na documentation ng Godot Engine, ang walang "
"bayad at open source na 2D at 3D engine na hinihimok ng komunidad! "
"Matatagpuan mo dito ang isa sa mga mabisa ngunit user-friendly na kagamitan "
"na maari mong gamitin na pang-develop ng kahit anong laro, para sa kahit "
"anong platform na walang hadlang sa pag-gamit."

#: ../../docs/about/introduction.rst:26
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This page gives a broad overview of the engine and of this documentation, so "
"that you know where to start if you are a beginner or where to look if you "
"need information on a specific feature."
msgstr ""
"Ang pahina na ito ay magbibigay ng mas malawak na paglalahad ng engine at "
"ang nilalaman ng documentation na ito upang malamak mo kung saan magsisimula "
"kung ikaw ay baguhan or kung nangangailangan ka ng sanggunian para sa isang "
"feature."

#: ../../docs/about/introduction.rst:31
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Bago ka magsimula"

