#: ../../docs/about/introduction.rst:44
msgid "About Godot Engine"
msgstr "Tungkol sa Godot Engine"

#: ../../docs/about/introduction.rst:46
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A game engine is a complex tool and difficult to present in a few words. "
"Here's a quick synopsis, which you are free to reuse if you need a quick "
"write-up about Godot Engine:"
msgstr ""
"Ang game engine ay isang kumplikadong bagay, kaya mahirap ipakita ang Godot "
"sa iilang salita. Ito ang synopsis na maaari mong gamitin kung kailangan mo "
"ng maiking buod tungkol sa Godot Engine."

#: ../../docs/about/introduction.rst:50
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Godot Engine is a feature-packed, cross-platform game engine to create 2D "
"and 3D games from a unified interface. It provides a comprehensive set of "
"common tools, so that users can focus on making games without having to "
"reinvent the wheel. Games can be exported with one click to a number of "
"platforms, including the major desktop platforms (Linux, macOS, Windows), "
"mobile platforms (Android, iOS), as well as Web-based platforms and consoles."
msgstr ""
"Ang Godot Engine ay isang feature-packed, pangmaramihang platform na game "
"engine para sa paglikha ng 2D at 3D na mga laro galing sa pinag-isang "
"interface. Nagbibigay ito ng komprehensibong grupo ng mga common tool, upang "
"makapagpokus ang mga gumagamit sa paglikha ng mga laro ng hindi muling "
"nililikha ang gulong. Ang mga laro ay maaaring i-export sa isang click para "
"sa iilang mga platform, kabilang ang mga pangunahing desktop platform "
"(Linux, macOS, Windows) pati na rin ang mga mobile (Android, iOS) at web-"
"based (HTML5) platform."

#: ../../docs/about/introduction.rst:57
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Godot is completely free and open source under the :ref:`permissive MIT "
"license <doc_complying_with_licenses>`. No strings attached, no royalties, "
"nothing. Users' games are theirs, down to the last line of engine code. "
"Godot's development is fully independent and community-driven, empowering "
"users to help shape their engine to match their expectations. It is "
"supported by the `Godot Foundation <https://godot.foundation/>`_ not-for-"
"profit."
msgstr ""
"Ang Godot ay likas na walang bayad at open source sa ilalim ng permissive "
"MIT license. Walang mga bawal, walang mga royalty, wala talaga. Ang mga laro "
"ng mga gumagamit ay sakanila, hanggang sa huling linya ng engine code. "
"Sarili at pinapagana ng komunidad ang pagdevelop ng Godot, upang mainganyo "
"ang mga gumagamit para tulungan ang engine na makuha ang ninanais nila. "
"Tinataguyod ito ng`Software Freedom Conservancy <https://"
"sfconservancy.org>`_ hindi-para-sa-kita."

