#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/standard_material_3d.rst:776
msgid ""
"Scales the object being rendered towards the camera to avoid clipping into "
"things like walls. This is intended to be used for objects that are fixed "
"with respect to the camera like player arms, tools, etc. Lighting and "
"shadows will continue to work correctly when this setting is adjusted, but "
"screen-space effects like SSAO and SSR may break with lower scales. "
"Therefore, try to keep this setting as close to 1.0 as possible."
