#: ../../docs/tutorials/animation/animation_tree.rst:373
msgid ""
"By default, blending happens in the *Continuous* mode, by interpolating "
"points inside the closest triangle in ``BlendSpace2D``, or in the line "
"between points in ``BlendSpace1D``. However, this may not always be the best "
