#: ../../docs/tutorials/math/beziers_and_curves.rst:194
msgid ""
"In Godot, there are two resources types to efficiently store curves of any "
"length: :ref:`Curve2D <class_Curve2D>` and :ref:`Curve3D <class_Curve3D>` "
"(for 2D and 3D respectively)."
